  "solution": "Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></semantics></math> là số ghế ở hàng thứ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>n</mi></semantics></math> (<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℕ</mi><mo>*</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>). Khi đó dãy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> là một cấp số cộng với số hạng đầu <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>27</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, công sai <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math>. <br>Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>n</mi></semantics></math> (<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℕ</mi><mo>*</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>) là số hàng ghế ở hội trường. Tổng số ghế ở hội trường là tổng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>n</mi></semantics></math> số hạng đầu của cấp số cộng đó. Ta có\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1275</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mo>⇔</mo></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><mi>n</mi><msub><mi>u</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1275</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mo>⇔</mo></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><mn>27</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1275</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mo>⇔</mo></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>26</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1275</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>31</mn><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tVì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℕ</mi><mo>*</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math> nên nhận <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn></mrow></semantics></math>. Số ghế ở hàng cuối cùng là \n\t\t<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mn>25</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>24</mn><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>27</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>75</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">ghế</mtext><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math>",
